---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use | Edubuzz" description="Terms and conditions for using Edubuzz — South Africa's education and career information hub." canonicalUrl={Astro.url.href}>
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-2">Last updated: May 2026</p>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">By using Edubuzz.co.za, you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use our services.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Eligibility</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">You must be at least 16 years old to use Edubuzz. By creating an account, you represent that you meet this requirement and that all information you provide is accurate.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Using our content</h2>
    <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed space-y-1 list-disc pl-5 mb-4">
      <li>Edubuzz provides educational and career information for general guidance</li>
      <li>Our content is researched and written for South African users, but requirements, funding rules and salary information change — always confirm details with the official institution or employer</li>
      <li>We are not responsible for the content of external websites we link to</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Prohibited conduct</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">You may not: post false or misleading information, use automated means to scrape or access the platform, impersonate others, attempt to breach platform security, or use the platform for any illegal purpose.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Intellectual property</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">The Edubuzz name, logo, and platform design are our intellectual property. Content submitted by users remains the property of the respective users, but you grant us a license to display it on the platform.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">Edubuzz is provided "as is" without warranties. We are not liable for any damages arising from use of the platform, including but not limited to: decisions made based on our content, inaccurate information, or service interruptions.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Changes to terms</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">We may update these terms at any time. Continued use of the platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Governing law</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">These terms are governed by the laws of the Republic of South Africa. Any disputes shall be resolved in South African courts.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-3 mt-8">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">For questions about these terms, contact us at <a href="/contact" class="text-green-800 hover:text-green-900 hover:underline">edubuzz.co.za/contact</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
